      "widgets_values": [
        "THREE SCENES — same bar, same couple\nIdentity = InstantID (NOT IPAdapter Plus).\n  ip-adapter.bin + instantid_controlnet.safetensors + Face Analysis CUDA\n  ApplyInstantIDAdvanced: ip 0.8, cn 0.8, start 0.3, end 1, noise 0.2, concat\n\nIf you see IPAdapter model not found, you loaded the OLD json. Load this file again.\nSofa depth = MiDaS (avoids Colab /tmp/ckpts Depth-Anything download failure).\n\n1. Scene 1 hug is txt2img master. InstantID image = that still.\n2. Scene 2 sofa = InstantID + MiDaS depth.\n3. Scene 3 POV = InstantID only. No depth.\n\nDo not edit LOOK / ROOM / PEOPLE. Only ACTION boxes.\n"
